            "review_title": "Review at L'Etoile",
            "review_text": "gwlj\nFort Lauderdale, Florida55 contributions\n0\nWorst excuse for French food ever\nFeb 2020 • Couples\nNot going to waste my time for a French restaurant with 1980s awards that serves French fries that are a poor mimic of McDonalds fries obviously just out of a frozen bag. Roast lamb was tough and tasted like cardboard and not much of it. Partner’s meal was no better.\nGo across the street to Bonjour Resto for a better French meal or McDonalds for this type of French fries.\nRead more\nWritten February 16, 2020",
