            "review_title": "Review at L'Etoile",
            "review_text": "Ro D.\nDarmstadt, Germany8 contributions\n0\nStill my favourite place for French style chicken\nFeb 2020 • Family\nThis restaurant's speciality is a chicken dish with a small variety of sauces. They have a small selection of fresh pastries as well. The staff is friendly and the place is clean. \n\nCompared to what I'm used to in Europe the prices are very cheap for the kind of quality meal you get. For Americans especially: the servings are relatively small and I would recommend ordering a side dish as well (like fries/chips for example).\n\nI have been here as a child and a few times in-between. Now it has been 10 years since I've last visited and the chicken is still roasted in a way that's perfectly soft inside and crispy outside for me. I recommend it with the wine sauce. My family loves this place and we come here everytime we're in Saigon. I adore the way they have been keeping the quality and look of the restaurant for over 30 years. I hope I can eat here again when I'm back.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 6, 2020",
