            "review_title": "Review at L'Etoile",
            "review_text": "Marsha M\nRoseville, California1 contribution\n0\nDifferent menus for locals & tourists -beware!\nDec 2016 • Family\nNoticed locals received separate menus with mostly same dishes (although theirs also had pizzas) but the real issue I had is when I saw their prices were 1/3 of the price compared to our menu! When I asked to speak to the manager they refused and became extremely rude. Too bad it took me a while to put this all together- I would've walked out right away had I known at the beginning of the meal. \nOnly decent item was the garden salad. Refer to the other traveler's reviews of the food-it is quite accurate!! HORRIBLE EXPERIENCE....well, unless you're a local & want to eat crappy food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 8, 2016",
