            "review_text": "Hugfrancis\nLondon, United Kingdom7 contributions\n0\nFailed to live up to their flattering self-description\nNov 2016 • Solo\n\"Outstanding Restaurant of the World\" it says as you look down at your table. I'm not sure 'outstanding' for what. Indifferent service, incorrect information (no cocktails - but they were on the menu), unusual but tasty onion soup, but a weak coq au vin (exactly 6 small chips and 6 haricots vert). No carafe of wine, but a glass of anonymous reddishness (perhaps cooled mulled wine?).\nA disappointing experience - I arrived and left almost unnoticed - perhaps it's me?\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 2, 2016",
